==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|VL.|fr}} {{m|la|*mentionica}}, from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} {{m|la|mentio}}, ''mentionis'' (in the sense of "lie" rather than "mention"), probably formed from haplology of a root {{m|la|*mentītiō}}, from {{m|la|mentītus}}, past participle of {{m|la|mentior}}. Compare also Italian {{m|la|menzogna}} and Old French {{m|fro|mensoigne}}, from a different root, and Romanian {{m|ro|minciună}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-mensonge.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/mɑ̃.sɔ̃ʒ/|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m}}

# a [[lie]] or [[falsehood]]

